Package: oocert
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Depends: libc6
Description: Sovereign CERTIFICATE STORE
 Manages local system trust roots under /etc/ssl/certs/ with revocation checking.
 Pure openOODA utility with zero ambient authority, terminal ergonomics,
 and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) server.
